      "short_description": "Rocket of Whispers is an award-winning post-apocalyptic adventure that follows two survivors on a journey to launch a space burial for the lost souls of their desolate world. Help them search the snowy wasteland for supplies and the courage to say goodbye.",
      "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean",
      "reviews": "“I fell in love with the post-apocalyptic wasteland the story took place in. The stellar soundtrack and warm art were particular highlights that really brought the rich universe of OPUS: Rocket of Whispers alive.”<br />\r\n35/40 – 法米通白金殿堂<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“A quiet tale like a trail in the snow, two forlorn souls seeking comfort in a dying world, and a slight touch of warmth. For a player like me, that's all I need.”<br />\r\n遊戲時光VGtime<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“If you like curling up with a good book as much as sitting down with a good game, Rocket of Whispers is a perfect way to spend an enjoyable afternoon.”<br />\r\nNintendo Life<br />\r\n",
